# The image build needs only the Go sources and module files. Keep secrets
# (the quick start's .env), music (compose's default ./library mount), VCS
# history, build output and test data out of the build context. `.*` covers
# every top-level dot entry: .env, .git and tool state.
.*
library
bin
dist
node_modules
fuzz-logs
**/testdata
**/*.test
waxflow.json
